# Service configuration

Set once for the whole skill:

- `{{ service.base_url_env }}` — base URL of the service.
- `{{ service.token_env }}` — bearer token for the service.

Per-interface overrides are optional:

{% for interface in interfaces %}
- `{{ interface.endpoint_env }}` overrides the endpoint for `{{ interface.slug }}`.
- `{{ interface.token_env }}` overrides the token for `{{ interface.slug }}`.
{% endfor %}

Default endpoint resolution: `{{ service.base_url_env }}.rstrip("/") + route`.
Default token resolution: `{{ service.token_env }}`.
